  "attempt_number": 3,
  "attempt_purpose": "Third freeze-plan attempt for R8. Attempt 2's plan was valid and its token was validated byte-exact, but the controller refused the freeze at its step-9 lineage gate, publishing nothing and consuming nothing; that gate is repaired and attempt 2 is preserved as SUPERSEDED_UNCONSUMED_AFTER_CONTROLLER_REFUSAL. Attempt 1's plan was built on a builder that named verification attempt 3 in a literal and carried an inherited sentence declaring R7 final; both are repaired here and attempt 1 is preserved unchanged beside it. R8 is the final revision. There is no R9, none is permitted, and this builder refuses if one appears on disk. The plan rests on verification attempt 6, which this builder discovered rather than assumed and which reports VERIFICATION_PASS_PRE_FREEZE_R8_FINAL.",
